        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "So the issue turns out to be that vim still retains `badd <filename>` for the session even if i dont reload the session and begin editing a new file. \nI don't have this issue in folke/persistance.nvim for example so I guess the question is whether the problem is out of the scope of this plugin. \nRelated Issue: https://github.com/vim/vim/issues/1393\nSimilar issue: https://stackoverflow.com/questions/5238251/deleting-buffer-from-vim-session",
